1
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:08,319
Chapter 20.

2
00:00:09,198 --> 00:00:15,260
But it happened that after walking for a long time through sand, and rocks, and snow,

3
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:20,119
the little prince at last came upon a road.

4
00:00:20,119 --> 00:00:25,819
And all roads lead to the abodes of men.

5
00:00:25,819 --> 00:00:29,960
"Good morning," he said.

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:35,979
He was standing before a garden, all a bloom with roses

7
00:00:38,119 --> 00:00:39,979
the roses.

8
00:00:39,979 --> 00:00:42,738
The little prince gazed at them.

9
00:00:42,738 --> 00:00:45,880
They all looked like his flower.

10
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,560
"Who are you?"

11
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:51,760
he demanded, thunderstruck.

12
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:57,260
"We are roses," the roses said.

13
00:00:57,260 --> 00:01:00,979
And he was overcome with sadness.

14
00:01:00,979 --> 00:01:05,719
His flower had told him that she was the only one of her kind in all the universe.

15
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:14,300
And here were five thousand of them, all alike, in one single garden!

16
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:21,319
"She would be very much annoyed," he said to himself, "if she could see that...

17
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:25,698
she would cough most dreadfully, and she would pretend that she was dying, to

18
00:01:25,698 --> 00:01:27,380
avoid being laughed at.

19
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:31,760
And I should be obliged to pretend that I was nursing her back to life--

20
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:39,920
for if I did not do that, to humble myself also, she would really allow herself to die..."

21
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:44,319
Then he went on with his reflections:

22
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:51,380
"I thought that I was rich, with a flower that was unique in all the world;

23
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:56,920
and all I had was a common rose.

24
00:01:58,939 --> 00:02:05,539
A common rose, and three volcanoes that come up to my knees--

25
00:02:05,539 --> 00:02:10,238
and one of them perhaps extinct forever...

26
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:16,238
that doesn't really make me a very great prince..."

27
00:02:16,819 --> 00:02:23,920
And he lay down in the grass and cried
